{"id":43882,"ord":68,"n_segments":178,"prev":43881,"next":43883,"doc":{"id":"52263","title":"52263_Sonny Greer oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Sonny Greer","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52263/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52263"},"chapter":"The Cotton Club and Hollywood","title":"Cotton Club personnel","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"Crouch and Greer reconstruct the band that went into the Cotton Club.","period":"1927","year_from":1927,"year_to":1927,"words":112,"start":[75,2],"end":[76,0],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52263#s43882","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[{"name":"Cotton Club","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Duke Ellington Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Duke Ellington"}]},"people":[{"name":"Johnny Hodges","qid":"Q455176","n":2},{"name":"Freddy Guy","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Bubber Miley","qid":"Q691572","n":1},{"name":"Lawrence Brown","qid":"Q727621","n":1},{"name":"Harry Carney","qid":"Q1375567","n":1},{"name":"Barney Bigard","qid":"Q497403","n":1},{"name":"Wellman Braud","qid":"Q488356","n":1},{"name":"Tricky Sam Nanton","qid":"Q725157","n":1}],"story":{"theme":34,"theme_name":"Who was in the band: naming sidemen and personnel","community":60,"community_name":"Who played in the band: reciting personnel","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":75,"b":2,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Now, how did you -- when you all went into the Cotton Club, what was the personnel of the band? when you all first started there?"},{"p":75,"b":3,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"It was you -- When we started at the Cotton Club?"},{"p":75,"b":4,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Yes."},{"p":75,"b":5,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"No, We only had six pieces. We had to run it from six to eleven. I don't recall."},{"p":75,"b":6,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"It was you, was Freddie Guy with the band?"},{"p":75,"b":7,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"Freddie."},{"p":75,"b":8,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Ellington, that's three. Bubber Miley. Tricky Sam, that's five."},{"p":75,"b":9,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"Then we got Carney."},{"p":75,"b":10,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Harry Carney came with you. Bigard, and --"},{"p":75,"b":11,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"Bigard and Johnny."},{"p":75,"b":12,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Hodges, okay."},{"p":75,"b":13,"s":"MR. GREER","x":"Lawrence Brown. Tizol."},{"p":75,"b":14,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"Braud And on bass. Right. That was"},{"p":76,"b":0,"s":"MR. CROUCH","x":"the band you took into the Cotton Club with you."}]}